{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659822",
      "title": "Disabling Buttons Conditionally",
      "sourceHash": "14fe6142599876743e1e27c99fa264cdf37bcfa86b89c0ca5f6fa35ea6966865",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.87,
          "end": 2.16,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 5.01,
          "en": "that we can't click the same button multiple times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.01,
          "end": 8.19,
          "en": "because that's really not helpful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.19,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "It also makes our log explode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 13.653,
          "en": "And of course, it's not really how this game should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.88,
          "end": 16.47,
          "en": "Now, how can we make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.47,
          "end": 19.68,
          "en": "that the same button can't be clicked multiple times?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.68,
          "end": 24.68,
          "en": "Well, we can simply go to the GameBoard component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.957,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "and in there, it would make sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 31.923,
          "en": "to disable the button once it has been selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.63,
          "end": 36.24,
          "en": "So here on this button component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.24,
          "end": 40.83,
          "en": "we can add the disabled prop because that is supported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.83,
          "end": 44.52,
          "en": "on the built-in button component, just as the button element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.52,
          "end": 48.81,
          "en": "in HTML has a disabled attribute which you can set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.81,
          "end": 50.85,
          "en": "And if we would just add it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.85,
          "end": 53.43,
          "en": "it would automatically be set to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.43,
          "end": 55.62,
          "en": "and the button would be disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.62,
          "end": 57.93,
          "en": "And as a result, if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.93,
          "end": 60,
          "en": "no button can be clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60,
          "end": 61.683,
          "en": "Nothing happens if I try that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.61,
          "end": 65.88,
          "en": "but, of course, now I wanna set this dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.88,
          "end": 69.3,
          "en": "I wanna set it to true if this button was already selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.3,
          "end": 72.18,
          "en": "by a player and set it to false otherwise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.18,
          "end": 74.013,
          "en": "if it should still be enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.97,
          "end": 77.4,
          "en": "So what could be our condition here to derive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 77.4,
          "end": 80.253,
          "en": "whether this should be disabled or not dynamically?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.15,
          "end": 84.99,
          "en": "Well, in the end, it's this player symbol.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.99,
          "end": 88.53,
          "en": "If player symbol is an X or O",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.53,
          "end": 91.59,
          "en": "that means that this button has already been clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.59,
          "end": 94.11,
          "en": "and that it should be disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.11,
          "end": 95.94,
          "en": "If it's null, on the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.94,
          "end": 98.13300000000001,
          "en": "we know that it's still enabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.24000000000001,
          "end": 100.92,
          "en": "So we can simply check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.92,
          "end": 105.753,
          "en": "if player symbol is not equal to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.31,
          "end": 110.72999999999999,
          "en": "Because if it is not equal to null, we know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.72999999999999,
          "end": 114.09,
          "en": "that it's either an X or an O",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.09,
          "end": 116.313,
          "en": "so that it has been picked already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 119.64,
          "en": "And therefore this will yield true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.64,
          "end": 122.22,
          "en": "if this button has been selected already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.22,
          "end": 124.56,
          "en": "And the button will therefore then be disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.56,
          "end": 126.15,
          "en": "if that's the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.15,
          "end": 128.37,
          "en": "If player symbol is equal to null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.37,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "so if this condition here is not met,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 134.463,
          "en": "this will yield false and the button will not be disabled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.54,
          "end": 137.133,
          "en": "And with that, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.12,
          "end": 140.91,
          "en": "you see I can click this button, I can click this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.91,
          "end": 142.71,
          "en": "but if I click this button again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.71,
          "end": 146.28,
          "en": "you see now the highlighted player does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.28,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "The log also does not change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 150.81,
          "en": "if I click the same button multiple times.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.81,
          "end": 152.85,
          "en": "And therefore now we're making sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.85,
          "end": 155.493,
          "en": "that every button can only be clicked once.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}